      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/e/2/e2bd7b4d57c4dc4e3ac193742ca44c2ced29c811.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/wlPRZFyW98zaG1ObapsFWIkPy9P.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/e/2/e2bd7b4d57c4dc4e3ac193742ca44c2ced29c811_2_573x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wlPRZFyW98zaG1ObapsFWIkPy9P\" width=\"573\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/e/2/e2bd7b4d57c4dc4e3ac193742ca44c2ced29c811_2_573x500.png, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/e/2/e2bd7b4d57c4dc4e3ac193742ca44c2ced29c811.png 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/e/2/e2bd7b4d57c4dc4e3ac193742ca44c2ced29c811.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F2F2\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">770×671 106 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Respect Sir<br>\nsir please explain me how this command is working</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/atulps\">@AtulPS</a>  kindly pls help us sir</p>",
